    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d443">

                <pb facs="0532" n="420" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg420"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 422.11G93/979</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Ecuador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hartman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Quito</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-10-25T19:00:00-05:14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 25, 1918, 7 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department’s October 14, 7 p.m. Daily deposits made regularly since August 8 in
                    Banco Commercial y Agricola amounting 67,000 sucres. London remittances.</p>
                <p>Will advise you as soon as possible whether Ecuadoran Government can withdraw
                    money if it so desires.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hartman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
